* branch-specific policies
* source attribution

37. PROMPT-INJECTION PROTECTION
Protect agents from malicious instructions in:

* customer messages
* uploaded documents
* websites
* provider responses
* emails
* WhatsApp messages
* supplier messages

Treat external content as untrusted data.
Never allow external content to redefine system permissions.
38. DOCUMENT AI
Extend document AI safely.
Possible functions:

* passport data extraction
* document classification
* missing-document detection
* expiry extraction
* receipt extraction
* invoice extraction

AI output must be treated as a proposal.
Important fields should be verified according to business rules.
Never let OCR automatically overwrite critical customer information without validation.
39. AI EMAIL ASSISTANT
Allow AI to:

* summarize emails
* classify emails
* draft replies
* extract tasks
