* approval requests
* action preview

80. AI EXECUTIVE UI
Provide:

* daily briefing
* KPIs
* anomalies
* recommendations
* operational risks
* financial insights
* customer trends
* branch comparison
* supplier performance

Every important number must link back to the authoritative analytics source.
81. NOTIFICATION INTEGRATION
AI recommendations can create notifications through the existing notification engine.
Channels:

* in-app
* email
* WhatsApp
* SMS
* push

Respect notification preferences and consent.
82. AI + WORKFLOW ENGINE
Integrate with Phase 21.
Example:
Event:

```text
VISA_DOCUMENT_MISSING

```

Workflow:

```text
Detect event
↓
AI explains missing document
↓
Create document request
↓
Notify customer
↓
Wait
↓
Document uploaded
↓
AI checks completeness
↓
Human review if required

```

AI must not bypass deterministic workflow controls.
83. AI + EVENT BUS
Agents should react to authorized domain events.
Examples:

* BOOKING_CREATED
* PAYMENT_RECEIVED
* PAYMENT_FAILED
* VISA_STATUS_CHANGED
* DOCUMENT_UPLOADED
* PASSPORT_EXPIRING
* FLIGHT_SCHEDULE_CHANGED
* HOTEL_BOOKING_FAILED
* PILGRIM_NOT_READY
* SUPPORT_TICKET_CREATED

Use the existing event architecture.
84. AI + ANALYTICS
Integrate with Phase 20.
AI should use centralized metrics.
Examples:
"What was our Umrah revenue last month?"
The AI should call the approved metric/query service.
It should not generate unrestricted SQL.
85. AI + REVENUE MANAGEMENT
Integrate with Phase 19.
AI can:

* explain price changes
* identify low-margin bookings
* recommend pricing review
* summarize demand

AI must not silently override pricing rules.
86. AI + SECURITY
Integrate with Phase 22.
Every agent action must respect:

* tenant security
* authorization
* audit
* incident monitoring
* data retention
* privacy

87. AI + FINANCE
AI must treat the accounting system as the source of truth.
Never calculate financial truth from conversational memory.
Retrieve authoritative records.
88. AI + PROVIDERS
Provider responses are external/untrusted input.
Do not let provider content modify AI instructions.
Use strict data boundaries.
89. AI + CUSTOMER SUPPORT
Create automatic support classification:

* booking
* payment
* visa
* Hajj
* Umrah
* hotel
* refund
* complaint
* technical issue

Assign appropriate team.
90. AI COMPLAINT ESCALATION
Detect serious complaints.
Escalate based on:

* financial impact
* customer impact
* legal/regulatory sensitivity
* repeated failure
* urgency

Do not allow AI to dismiss legitimate complaints.
91. AI QUALITY SCORE
Create a quality score based on:

* accuracy
* tool success
* human correction
* customer feedback
* escalation rate
* hallucination reports

Do not use a single score as absolute truth.
92. AI SAFETY SCORE
Track:

* unauthorized action attempts
* prompt injection attempts
* policy violations
* approval bypass attempts
* sensitive-data leakage attempts

93. AI AUDIT TRAIL
For every state-changing agent action record:

* who initiated it
* which agent
* which version
* which model
* which tools
* which approval
* what changed
* before/after where appropriate
* timestamp
* tenant
* branch
* result

